The explicit map is now in place for every admissible frozen-boundary volume and for the infinite component. One subtle correction emerged: an un-subtracted local observable does not become finite-support—it has exact left/right kink constants plus a finite-support remainder. The proof states the correct decomposition, which is precisely what local decay needs after channel subtraction.
