+
+*Justification.*  §§1--6 and D14--D16.
+
+**⟨2⟩2. QED.**
+
+**⟨1⟩2. PROVE.**  The displayed projected-sector transmission formula and
+quadratic soft zero no longer require Mq-E as a hypothesis.
+
+**⟨2⟩1.**  Claim M-tk proves the Fano matching and soft expansion conditional
