+D18 implication conditional only on the same enumeration/isomorphism.
+
+*Justification.*  Claims M-tk and Mq-AD3.
+
+**⟨2⟩2.**  Discharging that premise with ⟨1⟩1 yields, for the projected D16
+incoming component,
+
+\[
+ t(k)=\left[1+{iJ^2\over4\omega(k)v(k)}\right]^{-1},\qquad
+ T(k)=16(\Delta-1)^2k^2+O(k^4).
+\]
+
+*Justification.*  D15--D16, claim M-tk, and ⟨1⟩1.
+
+**⟨2⟩3.**  This closure does not assert the same formula for the unprojected
