+STATUS: PROVED-candidate
+Proved the full fixed-charge `≤3`-wall enumeration: only one rectangle row and one column lie in the incoming component; all rectangle-interior vertices are isolated after `P_3` compression.
+Constructed compatible finite/all-volume unitaries to the Jacobi path plus side level and checked the exact D16 energies/hoppings.
+Identified left/right kink bonds `m,m-2`, leg charges `-1,+1`, and the conserved total charge on every graph vertex.
+Corrected the locality clause: an un-subtracted local observable has two tail constants plus a finite-support remainder; the channel-subtracted observable is finite-support.
+`check_mq_e.py` passed 65 volume/charge pairs and its shifted-right-tail mutation failed as required.
