+`check_mq_e.py` passed 65 volume/charge pairs and its shifted-right-tail mutation failed as required.
+Therefore M-tk is unconditional on the projected incoming component; the unprojected full-chain leakage/universality questions remain open.
+PATCH.md targets `claims/CLAIMS.md`, `theory/memory-quantization.md`, `theory/corner-b-draft.md`, `theory/TRIANGLE.md`, `paper/main.tex`, and `paper/v2-claim-audit.md`.
