+*Justification.*  §§1--6 and D14--D16.  **⟨2⟩2. QED.**
+
+**⟨1⟩2. PROVE.**  On the projected incoming component, M-tk is unconditional:
+`t(k)=[1+iJ²/(4ω(k)v(k))]^{-1}` and
+`T(k)=16(Δ-1)²k²+O(k⁴)`.
+
+**⟨2⟩1.**  M-tk and Mq-AD3 prove these consequences conditional only on the
